# A priest (Docs/Design/83-dialogue-trees.md, Phase 3): Talk with a priest opens this. Restday's service (doc 42, its
# hours: Society::ServiceStart and ServiceEnd, here.service), the Restday dole for the poorest households (doc 79,
# 10.2), an offering for the church (doc 55's gift of coins, to the priest), the news, goodbye.

tree church
for job=priest
priority 1
entry talk greet

node greet
say #church_greet# | #blessing#. #church_greet# | #bless#. What brings you to us?
say[here.day=rest] #blessing#. It's Restday: the service is #here.service#. | #church_greet# It's Restday: the service is #here.service#.
say[topic.meeting=returning priority=6] Well, well. I've not seen you since #topic.since#. What brings you to us? | Look who it is. Not since #topic.since#! What brings you to us?
say[topic.meeting=famous priority=6] You #topic.deed#, didn't you? Folk talk of it still. What brings you to us? | So you're the one who #topic.deed#. What brings you to us?
say[topic.meeting=famous_look priority=6] You look like the one who #topic.deed#. Are you? What brings you to us? | I've heard of a wolf like you, who #topic.deed#. What brings you to us?
say[pair.disposition=wary priority=3] Yes? | What is it you want? | #bless#. What brings you?
say[pair.disposition=hostile priority=10] You. Say what you want and go. | What now? | Even you are welcome here. Just.
mood calm
free
choice When is the service? -> service
choice What does the church do for the poor? -> poor
choice An offering for the church. -> offering
choice Any news? -> do open news
choice Something else... -> do open chat
choice Goodbye. -> bye

node service
say On Restday, #here.service#. All are welcome, and the sermon's short. | Every Restday, #here.service#. Come and sit with us.
say[here.day=rest] Today, #here.service#. Come in, there's room. | Today: #here.service#. You're welcome to stay.
free
choice What does the church do for the poor? -> poor
choice An offering for the church. -> offering
choice Goodbye. -> bye

node poor
say On Restday, the hungriest households are given a day's bread. It's not much, but nobody starves. | Bread on Restday, for the households that have none.
free
choice An offering for the church. -> offering
choice Goodbye. -> bye

node offering
say Whatever you can spare is welcome. | Every penny feeds someone.
choice A penny. -> do offering 1 ; then thanked ; refused refused
choice Five pennies. -> do offering 5 ; then thanked ; refused refused
choice Twenty pennies. -> do offering 20 ; then thanked ; refused refused
choice Not today. -> greet

node thanked
say #blessing#. It will feed someone. | Thank you. #blessing#.
mood pleased
choice Goodbye. -> bye

node refused
say #topic.why# | Bless you for thinking of it. #topic.why#
choice Goodbye. -> bye

node bye
say #blessing#. | #bless#. | #farewell#, #address#.
end
